        <briefdescription>
<para>Write the frame to a file descriptor using writev(2). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The header and payload are written atomically as a scatter-gather vector; no intermediate copy is performed.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fd</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Open, writable file descriptor (TCP socket). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Total bytes written on success (&gt;= 0), or -1 on error (errno is set by the underlying writev call). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
